# Go

- GraphQL schema first (gqlgen). Do not hand-roll a parallel REST resource API.
- Pass `context.Context` through store and LLM calls. Honor cancel on user stop.
- Do not import UI packages. Platform code stays in `services/api`.
- Wrap errors with `%w`. Do not panic in resolvers.
- Secrets from env, never committed. Local/dev mock is allowed when credentials are missing.
